  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatch3.MaybeJustMaybe": "[pg]And maybe, just maybe, you'll even see her and her little sister again in this big, bustling city."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatch3.PickingYourselfUp": "[pg]Picking yourself up and sparing a last look at the almost surreal scene, you trudge back through the labyrinth of alleyways and head towards the mighty gates of Tel'Adre. Back in the desert outside, you briefly wonder if Lara's going to break her word and you'll be greeted by a group of guards next time you visit, but something tells you she won't."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatch3.TryToIntroduceYourself": "[pg][say: I'm Lara, by the way, nice to meet you~] You try to introduce yourself, but she immediately cuts you off with a dismissive wave. [say: Don't care. You're a pervert, that's all you are.] She turns to leave, when a long-forgotten thought surfaces again in your mind: what about their mother?"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.EyelidsFlutterEnjoys": "[pg]Her eyelids flutter as she enjoys the gentle hand on her head, then her dozy gaze finally falls on you, sitting not far away on the stairs, watching. [say: Uhm... Sis? Who's... that?]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.FaceLightsUp": "Her face lights up into pure, wicked glee as you agree to her conditions."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.HmmSay": "[pg][say: Hmm?]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.HmmnnmImTiredSis": "[pg][say: Hmmnnm... I'm tired, sis. And we gotta find Mommy.]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.JustASpinelessStranger": "[pg][say: Just a spineless stranger, Lynn. Ignore [him].]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.LovinglyStrokesHerFace": "[pg][say: Shhh, not yet. But I will, don't worry.] She lovingly strokes her face. [say: Just leave it to me.]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.MovedOnFromCaressing": "[pg][say: You don't wanna play?] She's moved on from caressing her face, to scratching a particular spot behind one of her fluffy ears."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.NimblyBendsDown": "[pg]She nimbly bends down to kiss Lynn on the cheek and whispers, [say: Just for a little bit. And then we go find Mommy, I promise.] Lynn mumbles something, but slowly seems to wake up as she turns to invite her sister's lips to hers."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.SheDrunkenlyMumbles": "[pg][say: Hmmnnn... Sis?] she drunkenly mumbles. [say: What... Where are we? Where's Mommy? Have you found her?]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.StillCheshireSmile": "[pg]Still a Cheshire smile on her face, but apparently done with mocking you, she puts her sister's head in her lap, cradling her while starting to stroke her side and ears. As she's petting her like a real kitten, the younger girl stirs. A tiny twitch of her hands at first, then her feet, then she suddenly stretches fully in her big sister's lap, yawning softly, eyes slowly cracking open."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.StingsLessNow": "[pg][say: Pathetic!] For some reason, it stings less when her grin is as wide as it is now. [say: So pathetic! Look at you, pervert! Haah... But just the kind of pathetic I like,] she almost growls, her tail twitching behind her."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.WasteVeryLittleTime": "[pg]They waste very little time with light pecking before the older one, mischievously meeting your rapt eyes, parts her lips and pushes her tongue into her little sister's mouth, making sure you're watching everything as she starts to devour her, ravishing her lips and plunging in as far as she can, leaving neither of them much room to breathe."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.WhatAreYouDoing": "[pg][say: What are you doing?]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.WhatStartedInnocent": "[pg]What started out as an innocent, sisterly kiss soon evolves into an exceedingly passionate, incestuous make-out session between them, the soft, wet slurping sounds alone enough to drive you wild with thirst. But you're only going to watch, nothing else. Your hands painfully dig into the stone step, desperately trying to resist temptation."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAgree.YoungerLynnSeemsAwfully": "[pg][say: Hmmn... okay...] The younger, Lynn, still seems awfully drowsy, barely able to keep her eyes open. [say: ...Sis?]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAnswer.AnotherSnortChuckling": "[pg][say: You really are a weirdo, pervert!] Another snort. [say: Disgusting!] She exhales, still chuckling. [say: Well, still a good answer.] Finally calm, she turns to you."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAnswer.HasToBeHers": "It has to be hers. Pink hearts are the absolute best, there is no doubt. Plus, they smelled and tasted amazing, as your mind brings back to memory. She bursts out laughing--or rather cackling--at your explanation, almost waking up her sister before calming down and dropping both their dresses again."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAnswer.HasToBeSister": "It has to be her sister's. White hearts are the absolute cutest when it comes to a little girl's underwear. She glares at you. Did you say the wrong thing? Did you anger her? But then, she bursts out laughing, threatening to wake up her sister before calming down again and dropping both their dresses."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAnswer.HumsLookingYouUp": "[pg][say: Hmm...] she hums, looking you up and down."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAnswer.MayBeHint": "[pg][say: Haaah... You're right. She is the cutest. The absolute cutest...] There may be a hint of jealousy, but you have no time to ponder on that as she turns to you again."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchAnswer.RaisesAFinger": "[pg][say: You know, you're not too bad, pervert. Disgusting, but not too bad. I think I'll really let you stay. You can watch while I play with my cute little sister... But]--she raises a finger--[say: if you make any noise, or touch yourself, I'm going to kick you and tell the guards what you did... and more.] You get the distinct feeling her threat is not a tease, and she's dead-serious about siccing the guards on you if you don't do as she says.[if (cor > 75) { The brief thought of killing her in that case flits through your mind, but a double murder of children in the middle of Tel'Adre might be something not even you could get away with.}]"
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchBail.BitTooMuch": "That's a bit too much for you; you have to get out, right now. Her face turns to one of pure contempt as you get up to leave."
  "Scenes.Kittens.KittensWatchBail.LastThingSheSpits": "[pg][say: You really are pathetic. Not even a pervert, just a coward,] is the last thing she spits before you turn around and hurry your way back through the labyrinth of alleyways. As you walk through the mighty gates of Tel'Adre and towards your campsite, you hope she'll really keep her earlier word and you won't be greeted by a whole squad of guards next time you visit. Either way, you doubt you'll ever see her again, even from behind bars."
}
